## What you get

A single **runtime** module named `{{PLUGIN_NAME}}` that depends only on `Core`,
`CoreUObject` and `Engine` — all of which ship with the engine. There is no
editor module, no content, no assets, and no dependency on any paid or
Marketplace plugin.

